{"text": "DM \u2014 hai\nRJ Reynolds **; pene\nSAM. JA PUB,\n\nLORI, MacWILLIAMS\n(Chain Accounts Manager\n\na\n\n\u201cTobacco Company\n\nSENT VIAELECTRONIG MAIL\n\nFebruary 16, 1993\nLEM-074-93\n\nTo: All Divisions With Truckstops of America Stations\n\nRe: Truckstops of America\nCID #1370-00-00\nCamel Special Lights King\nCamel Special Lights Box\nCamel Special Lights Box 100\nIntroduction\n\nDivision Managers:\n\nPlease be advised that Mr. Gary Slaby/Purchasing Specialist for\nTruckstops of America has authorized distribution of Camel Special Lights\nKing/Box/Box 100 for all corporate Truckstops of America locations. A\nforced distribution of two (2) cartons each style will be made to all\nlocations during the week of March 29, 1993. Product should be utilized to\nset our preferred presence counter displays, based on regional guidelines\nin your marketplace. Sales representatives should place an additional\norder with store managers as needed.\n\nIntroductory promotions, April B1G1F and May Brass Lighter with two-\npack purchase have been approved by Mr. Slaby via our Value-Added\ndistribution program (reference my E-Mail, LEN-060-93 of 2/09/93). Please\nwork with divisions responsible for administering VAP relative to\nnecessary transfers of produce/premiums.\n\nBy copy of this letter, | am requesting divisions responsible for Truckstops\n\u2018of America suppliers to ensure pre-book order is handled with respective\nDirect Accounts. Pre-book will follow via FAX to Divisions responsible for\nDirect Accounts only,\n\n68r6 6bets", "words": [{"text": "DM", "x0": 383, "y0": 68, "x1": 408, "y1": 79, "conf": 93.0}, {"text": "\u2014", "x0": 411, "y0": 40, "x1": 446, "y1": 99, "conf": 82.0}, {"text": "hai", "x0": 455, "y0": 44, "x1": 562, "y1": 95, "conf": 23.0}, {"text": "RJ", "x0": 121, "y0": 87, "x1": 185, "y1": 118, "conf": 66.0}, {"text": "Reynolds", "x0": 191, "y0": 84, "x1": 335, "y1": 124, "conf": 66.0}, {"text": "**;", "x0": 383, "y0": 90, "x1": 423, "y1": 122